// AN OPP PLATE ON A 6 MM STEP: THE NEAREST PLATE THAT CAN BE MADE IS FAR FROM ITS 150 KPA DUTY.
// EXPECT: 4 NONCOMPLIANT
UNITS LENGTH M
UNITS ELEVATION M
UNITS SIZE MM
UNITS PRESSURE KPA
UNITS FLOW LPM
UNITS KFACTOR LPM/KPA
METHOD HW
USE BORE 120
OPTION ORIF_STEP 6
WATER SRC 0 1000
NODE J1 0
NODE A 0
HYDRANT A2 0 400 28.28427125
PIPE M1 SRC J1 20 100
PIPE P1 J1 A 12 50
USE ASAM
PIPE OP1 A A2 0 50
OPP OP1 150
